From d71c66dfe9d446d5dae73771e30d03b3085dc817 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: QuizSpark Dev <dev@quizspark.local>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 00:17:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(ui): redesigned My Page tabs (profile, records, question
 history, titles, genres)

- shared qt-* styles; form fields use real <label>s; avatar change is a keyboard-operable button
- titles are a radiogroup (aria-checked, locked ones disabled); records list uses SVG medals/skull and circle/x marks
- fix: RecordsTab declared a type named Record that shadowed TypeScript's Record (type error)
- fix: GenreRadarTab tooltip formatter typing; user.bio/username/titleId now typed (no 'as any')
- behaviour unchanged: API calls, confirm() dialogs, save flows kept as-is
- emoji baseline 120 -> 99
